    "sentence_translations": [
      "Sichuan's Spicy Sisters",
      "",
      "Talking about Sichuan cuisine, your first impression must be spicy.",
      "Besides spicy food, have you heard of the Sichuan's “spicy sisters”?",
      "We're not talking about literal spicy sisters, the meaning refers to Sichuan's sexy, pretty and violent-tempered young girls.",
      "In Chinese, we often use the word “fire - spicy” to describe a person with sexy body or violent temper.",
      "Because of girls’ “fire - spicy” temper, men in Sichuan are usually afraid of their girlfriends or wives, ...",
      "... so they also received a funny nickname “Pa Erduo”, which literally means “soft ear”.",
      "In other words, the men listen to everything their girlfriends or wives say.",
      "If you go to Sichuan, not only must you have a taste of the cuisine, but also be careful of the the “spicy girls”."
    ]
